# Plunder the Trollshaws is cast on turn 1 (draws one) and again from the graveyard with flashback on turn 3 (Black Lotus' blue
# and a Mox Sapphire pay {3}{U}); with it on the stack Bot1 flashes in Lutri, the Spellchaser ({1}{R}{U}: Mox Ruby, Mox Sapphire,
# Mox Jet), whose enters trigger copies it. The copy resolves first and draws ONE; the original draws two. Cards drawn in all:
# the turn-3 draw, 1, 1 and 2, so the library, 20 - 7 in the hand, is 8.

